# Push a change to this file to run a backtest without the GitHub connector.
# Format: one line, "MODE [MONTHS]". Lines starting with # are ignored.
# The mode must also be in the fetch-step whitelist in backtest.yml, or it will
# silently get the short-history fetcher (see the v78bt note in CLAUDE.md).
#
# v85bt: the control v84bt needed. v84bt's best Wyckoff row upsized the group
# its own part A measured as WORSE and still scored +20 points — so it is not
# reading its feature. This runs a uniform DONCH4H risk multiplier with no
# feature attached, plus the INVERTED tilt, to separate "Wyckoff works" from
# "smaller breakout tickets work". Also re-anchors the incumbent, because two
# simulator bugs (ROTA funding, slippage in the ladder exits) were fixed after
# v84bt ran and every number in CLAUDE.md predates them.
v85bt 36
